# 詞: 睇怕

1. 佢咁細個就可以代表香港參加羽毛球比賽，認真威水。 (He represented Hong Kong in a badminton competition at a young age. He's such an outstanding person.)
2. 呢個項目咁複雜，睇怕要成個月先搞得掂。 (This project is so complicated; I'm afraid it will take a whole month to finish.)
3. 佢成日遲到，今次睇怕又會遲到。 (He's always late; I'm afraid he'll be late again this time.)
4. 天氣預報話有暴雨，睇怕今日嘅戶外活動要取消。 (The weather forecast says there will be heavy rain; I'm afraid today's outdoor activity will have to be cancelled.)
5. 佢病咗咁耐，睇怕要入醫院檢查下。 (He's been sick for so long; I'm afraid he needs to go to the hospital for a check-up.)
6. 呢間餐廳咁多人排隊，睇怕要等好耐先有位。 (This restaurant has so many people queuing; I'm afraid we'll have to wait a long time for a table.)
7. 佢份報告寫得咁差，睇怕老闆會唔滿意。 (His report is written so poorly; I'm afraid the boss won't be satisfied.)
8. 呢個價錢咁貴，睇怕我哋買唔起。 (This price is so expensive; I'm afraid we can't afford it.)
9. 佢咁夜都未返嚟，睇怕出咗事。 (He hasn't come back so late; I'm afraid something has happened.)
10. 呢個問題咁難，睇怕冇人答得出。 (This question is so difficult; I'm afraid no one can answer it.)

